# Hermes Build Target

This repo is the default build/deploy target for Hermes Agent (kalabar794's
Railway deployment).

When Jonathon asks Hermes "build me a website" / "build a quick X" / similar
one-off code projects without naming a different repo, the output lands here.

- Wired: 2026-05-23
- Token env on hermes-agent: $HERMES_BUILD_TOKEN
- Repo env on hermes-agent: $HERMES_BUILD_REPO (= kalabar794/hermes)
- Token scope: this repo only (fine-grained PAT, admin/push/pull)
- Auto-deploy: none yet — repo is storage. Enable Pages/Vercel/Cloudflare
  separately to get a live URL on push.

Default workflow:
  git clone https://x-access-token:$HERMES_BUILD_TOKEN@github.com/kalabar794/hermes.git
  # generate / replace files in repo root
  git -c user.name='Hermes' -c user.email='hermes@weomedia.com' commit -am '...'
  git push origin main
